{
  "name": "cra-article14-clock",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA) Article 14 reporting clock: compute the 24h/72h/14d deadlines from your moment of awareness, draft the ENISA/CSIRT early-warning, 72h notification and final report, and export a CSAF 2.0 advisory. Runs on your machine, no network, no data leaves your computer.",
